            "wing": "New Wing",
            "name": "Self-Service Collection",
            "text": "拍学生证进入，取课程指定参考书（course reserve）和自己预约的书（按姓氏字母排列）；室内有 A3 高拍扫描仪。"
          },
          {
            "kind": "tech",
            "wing": "New Wing",
            "name": "Battery Charging Stations（充电站）",
            "text": "在 Atrium 旁，有 Type-C、Lightning、Micro-B 线，可同时充 7 台设备；有人等候时请不超过 30 分钟。"
          },
          {
            "kind": "tech",
            "wing": null,
            "name": "Ingenium",
